@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# Changes in 1.4.3
+
+- Kept the simplified spare-parts catalog fields: serial number, part name, category, brand, model, notes, and optional current stock.
+- Made Add/Edit Spare Part substantially more compact by placing Serial + Current stock and Brand + Model on shared rows.
+- Added quick category suggestions while keeping category free-text for custom values.
+- Preserved the category filter chips above the Spare Parts list for faster searching.
+- Disabled dialog window animations for the spare-part editor to avoid the previous dancing/bouncing window effect.
+- Preserved all v1.4.2 PDF header, ghosting, and report-editor stability fixes.
+- Version updated to 1.4.3 (10403).
